Domain name: NMG.com
OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users
Purpose of each OU: (briefly describe what each department represents)
• Finance OU: The team handling the company's money. This space covers the
people and tools managing payroll, budgets, invoices, and financial reporting.
• HR OU: The team looking after our people. It holds the accounts and resources
used for hiring, onboarding, benefits, employee support, and confidential personnel
records.
• IT OU: The crew keeping the tech running and secure. This area manages support
staff, admin tools, and the hardware and software powering everyday operations.
• Operations OU: The engine behind daily business. It covers the staff and systems
managing logistics, facilities, and day-to-day workflows to make sure everything
gets delivered on time.
